<title>USA: CBOT membership sells for record $725,000.</title>
<headline>CBOT membership sells for record $725,000.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade (CBOT) said a full membership sold for a record $725,000 Wednesday.</p>
<p>The prior record sale price was $710,000 set in January 1995. A membership sold for $700,000 in January 1997.</p>
<p>The CBOT said the current bid/ask for a full membership is $700,000/$800,000.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
